{"step_index":102,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T10:27:44Z","content":"I love that idea! It’s tedious to type stocks one by one when you just want the market to tell you what's ready to buy today. \n\nI've just rolled out a major update to the app! If you check your browser at **http://localhost:8501**, you'll now see two tabs:\n\n### 1. 🎯 Discovery Scanner (Find New Buys)\nThis is exactly what you asked for. I have pre-loaded the top 30 highly liquid Malaysian blue-chip stocks (KLCI components) and the top 30 US Tech Mega-Caps.\nAll you have to do is select the market and click **\"Run Full Market Scan\"**. \nThe app will silently scan all 30 stocks in the background and filter out everything else. It will **ONLY show you stocks that currently have a 🟢 BUY SIGNAL or 🟡 WATCH status**, telling you exactly what the entry price, TP, and CL should be for today!\n\n### 2. 💼 My Portfolio (Check Holds/Sells)\nThis is the original manual tracker we built earlier. You can continue using this tab with the `@price` feature to monitor the stocks you've already bought and wait for the app to tell you when it's time to Take Profit or Cut Loss!\n\nGo ahead and give the **Discovery Scanner** a spin! Let me know if you find any good setups today!"}
